<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,813.06 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,813.06 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at a sixth successive closing high of 7,813.06 points, up 99.34 points or 1.29 percent, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 6.239 billion forints, down from 7.651 billion on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
